<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v1.3 20210610//EN" "https://jats.nlm.nih.gov/archiving/1.3/JATS-archivearticle1-3.dtd">
<article article-type="research-article" xml:lang="en" dtd-version="1.3">
  <front>
    <article-meta>
      <title-group>
        <article-title>A Body-Content Article for JATS Export</article-title>
      </title-group>
      <contrib-group>
        <contrib contrib-type="author">
          <string-name>Test Author</string-name>
        </contrib>
      </contrib-group>
      <abstract>
        <p>This abstract has <italic>italic</italic> and <bold>bold</bold> and <monospace>inline code</monospace> interleaved
with prose to verify the slice 5b paragraph-grouping fix.</p>
      </abstract>
    </article-meta>
  </front>
  <body>
    <sec>
      <title>Lists</title>
      <p>An unordered list:</p>
      <list list-type="bullet">
        <list-item>
          <p>First item with <italic>emphasis</italic>.</p>
        </list-item>
        <list-item>
          <p>Second item.</p>
        </list-item>
      </list>
      <p>An ordered list:</p>
      <list list-type="order">
        <list-item>
          <p>One</p>
        </list-item>
        <list-item>
          <p>Two</p>
        </list-item>
      </list>
      <p>A definition list:</p>
      <def-list>
        <def-item>
          <term>term-A</term>
          <def>
            <p>Definition A with prose.</p>
          </def>
        </def-item>
        <def-item>
          <term>term-B</term>
          <def>
            <p>Definition B.</p>
          </def>
        </def-item>
      </def-list>
    </sec>
    <sec>
      <title>Math</title>
      <p>Inline math <inline-formula><tex-math><![CDATA[E = mc^2]]></tex-math></inline-formula> in a paragraph.</p>
      <p>A numbered display equation:</p>
      <disp-formula id="eqn:euler">
        <label>(1)</label>
        <tex-math><![CDATA[e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0]]></tex-math>
      </disp-formula>
      <p>An align environment with two lines:</p>
      <disp-formula>
        <label>(2)</label>
        <tex-math><![CDATA[\begin{aligned}
a^2 + b^2 &= c^2 \\
x + y &= z
\end{aligned}]]></tex-math>
      </disp-formula>
    </sec>
    <sec>
      <title>Theorem family</title>
      <statement content-type="theorem" id="thm:pyth">
        <label>Theorem 1.</label>
        <title>Pythagoras</title>
        <p>If <inline-formula><tex-math><![CDATA[a^2 + b^2 = c^2]]></tex-math></inline-formula> then the triangle is right-angled.</p>
      </statement>
      <statement content-type="proof">
        <label>Proof.</label>
        <p>By similar triangles. ∎</p>
      </statement>
    </sec>
    <sec>
      <title>Links</title>
      <p>External links export as ext-link, e.g. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://example.org/spec">an external spec</ext-link>; an internal link to a fragment id exports as a cross-reference, e.g. <xref rid="thm:pyth">the Pythagoras theorem</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec>
      <title>Frameables</title>
      <fig id="fig:elephant">
        <label>1</label>
        <caption>
          <p>An elephant.</p>
        </caption>
        <graphic xlink:href="elephant.jpg"/>
      </fig>
      <table-wrap id="tab:demo">
        <label>1</label>
        <caption>
          <p>A small CSV table.</p>
        </caption>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>a</th>
              <th>b</th>
              <th>c</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>1</td>
              <td>2</td>
              <td>3</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </table-wrap>
    </sec>
  </body>
</article>
